 "notes": "Key as of 2026-10-21 (thread \"Outdated fees and deposits\"), matched to the saved pages of backend/evals/fees/pages/609.json (found 2026-10-15). The ТАКСИ ОБУЧЕНИЕ page publishes the 2026/27 fee table: the annual English-programme fee per printed row is this school's tuition (yearly; the school charges no other tuition), each row's 2- and 9/10-instalment amounts are key fees with no period (as in 596's key), the second-language supplement is extracurricular and yearly ('доплащане към годишната такса'), the admission prep course is extracurricular and the psychologist/speech-therapist session is activities (per session, no period). Admission fees: the 30 EUR exam/assessment and the 250 EUR enrolment fee per stage are one_time (f1-f4); the mandatory 2-week course before 1st grade is camp (f5). Summer school: 4, 3 and 2 weeks have no period; 1 week is weekly (f12) and 1 day daily (f13). The 2026/27 textbook set (f14) is yearly, as check_fee reads a dated school year. The 2023/24 5th-grade fee (2400 лв, old f6/f7) is no longer on the pages and was dropped. The candidates (o1-o14) record the judging of the 2026-10-13 step-3 run against the key as it was then (f12/f13/f14 with no period); they are history, not re-scored."
